"use strict";(self.webpackChunk_N_E=self.webpackChunk_N_E||[]).push([[8520],{18520:e=>{e.exports=JSON.parse('{"slug":"aktivy-nestle-auchan-vremennoe-upravlenie","locale":"en","title":"Nestle, Auchan, Lemana Pro and FM Logistic assets placed under temporary management by LEV Management","description":"A presidential decree placed the Russian assets of Nestle, Auchan, Lemana Pro and FM Logistic under LEV Management. Its manager has already told Auchan that shops and procurement will continue. Ownership remains unchanged on paper, but control has moved.","blocks":[{"id":"b001","kind":"paragraph","text":"The Russian assets of four companies have been placed under the control of an entity belonging to LEV Management, under a presidential decree. For Auchan, the measure covers 100% of the shares in Auchan LLC. This is another step in a long series of forced transfers of control over businesses from countries Russia labels unfriendly. After 2022, Western companies tried to sell their Russian subsidiaries or wind down operations, but the ability to exit an asset came to depend on official approval rather than the owner\'s wishes."},{"id":"b002","kind":"paragraph","text":"The management company was established in late 2025 and is headed by a general from the Interior Ministry. It has no public track record in retail or logistics. LEV Management chief executive Andrey Krayushkin wrote to Auchan\'s management. He promised to keep the chain intact, maintain procurement, deliveries and store operations, and fulfil obligations to customers, suppliers and employees. He linked Auchan\'s stable operation to food security."},{"id":"b003","kind":"paragraph","text":"The letter contains less expected promises too. Krayushkin pledged to protect the chain\'s real estate from attacks, including drone attacks, and retain Auchan\'s existing management without revising its working conditions. The chain confirmed receiving the letter, said it was ready to work with the manager and reported that all facilities were operating normally."},{"id":"b004","kind":"paragraph","text":"The four assets differ in scale. Auchan has 241 Russian stores, including 62 hypermarkets, and more than 33 thousand employees. Lemana Pro is the former Leroy Merlin and, like Auchan, belongs to the Mulliez family. Russia contributes a little over 1% of Nestle\'s global sales, compared with roughly 2% before 2022; the company has already scaled back most sales, imports, advertising and investment. FM Logistic\'s main assets are not warehouses but contracts, routes and customer trust, which a decree cannot transfer."},{"id":"b005","kind":"paragraph","text":"The mechanics of temporary management are simpler than the phrase suggests. Imagine an apartment whose documented owner stays the same, while an appointed manager takes the keys, tenancy agreement and rent. Title remains in place, but decisions and money move to someone else. Formally, the arrangement is reversible and is not called confiscation. In practice, the owner can no longer freely sell the asset, choose a buyer or lock in a price."},{"id":"b006","kind":"paragraph","text":"For Auchan shoppers, nothing changes today, according to the chain itself. The written promises are to retain management and honour obligations to employees and suppliers. A promise is not a guarantee, but it is on paper and the chain has confirmed receiving it. The risks lie elsewhere: imported Nestle products and FM Logistic contracts with foreign customers who may not want to work with an asset under its new status. There are no estimates of the scale."},{"id":"b007","kind":"paragraph","text":"What remains unknown is whether owners will receive compensation, whether the product range will change and whether temporary management will become permanent. For an ordinary person, stockpiling groceries at Auchan because of this news means paying full price for anxiety the chain has publicly sought to dispel. But saying the management change affects nobody would also be wrong: for 33 thousand people it concerns pay, and for shoppers it concerns who now decides what goes on the shelves and why."}],"sources":[{"label":"https://www.kommersant.ru/doc/8971025","url":"https://www.kommersant.ru/doc/8971025"},{"label":"https://tass.ru/ekonomika/28132697","url":"https://tass.ru/ekonomika/28132697"},{"label":"https://finance.yahoo.com/economy/policy/articles/russia-seizes-assets-nestle-french-102315087.html","url":"https://finance.yahoo.com/economy/policy/articles/russia-seizes-assets-nestle-french-102315087.html"}],"sourceBodySha256":"cf5b07eda074b3ba8f645b2e30d77d8c2bb3b88d7ecf919b61965f4aca16693c"}')}}]);